<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Morgan Stanley starts 5 biotechs.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Morgan Stanley starts 5 biotechs.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Morgan Stanley said analyst Doug Lind initiated coverage of five biotechnology stocks.</p>
<p>-- Lind put strong buy ratings on Agouron Pharmaceuticals Inc and Amgen Inc, the brokerage said.</p>
<p>-- He put outperform ratings on Liposome Co Inc, MedImmune Inc and Protein Design Labs Inc.</p>
</text>
